{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nKodak SlideTag 鎖匙扣相框一開賣已經引起大家熱烈討論，很多地方更已經售罄了，到底有甚麼吸引力呢？靈感源自 1935 年經典 Kodachrome 彩色正片紙框幻燈片，機身僅重約 16.6 克，微縮造型小巧輕便。SlideTag 配備1.54吋6色全彩電子墨水螢幕，透過App可上傳最多12張照片離線自動輪播；畫面更能隨時切換成待辦清單、日曆、倒數計時、QR Code或行李聯絡名牌。同時支援Apple Find My 與 Google Find Hub雙重定位網路，具備 IP54 防水及 75dB 蜂鳴器尋物功能。產品以典藏盲盒形式發售，共設 8 款復古配色加 1 款隱藏版，掛上手袋上已經很好看了！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553601850732677_693943796b05b492dca13.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553601850732677_693943796b05b492dca13.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602049461431_4609310276b05b49524121.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602049461431_4609310276b05b49524121.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602230831287_5361193396b05b496bf480.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602230831287_5361193396b05b496bf480.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602400892964_1424695716b05b4987758e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602400892964_1424695716b05b4987758e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602610368910_11472964866b05b49a8cf08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553602610368910_11472964866b05b49a8cf08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgIHt6yAnWy/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:24:25.033863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":427,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T16:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:17:12.296090+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:17:50.784033+00:00","content_hash":"cf074d07073c62b7b507902339fca9cb13d24b81b8d8b8d8c85f23bf36ef65aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}